redistributed under that corpus's licence.

SOURCE
  Title    LBox Open (lbox_open), task ljp_criminal
  Creator  LBox Co., Ltd.
  Source   https://github.com/lbox-kr/lbox-open
           https://huggingface.co/datasets/lbox/lbox_open
  Licence  Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International
           (CC BY-NC 4.0)
           Deed:       https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
           Legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode

  Cite as  Hwang, W., Lee, D., Cho, K., Lee, H., & Seo, M. (2022). A Multi-Task
           Benchmark for Korean Legal Language Understanding and Judgement
           Prediction. Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems 35,
           Datasets and Benchmarks Track. arXiv:2206.05224

MODIFICATIONS MADE BY THE AUTHORS
  Indicated as required by CC BY-NC 4.0, Section 3(a)(1)(B).

  1. Filtered to casename == "도로교통법위반(음주운전)" (Road Traffic Act
     violation, drunk driving), yielding 1,644 records.
  2. Removed 144 duplicated records. The source test2 split is a strict subset
     of the source test split (same id, facts, and label), leaving 1,500
     unique cases.
  3. Recoded label.imprisonment_with_labor_lv (0-4 in this subset) into a
     4-class ordinal target, merging levels 1 and 2.
  4. Added five feature columns created by the authors - blood alcohol
     concentration, driving distance, vehicle type, prior-DUI count, and
     offence year - rule-extracted from the facts text and then verified case
     by case by a licensed Korean attorney.
  5. Added a group_key grouping index derived from normalised facts text.
  6. The facts, reason, and ruling text of retained records is reproduced
     verbatim. No text was altered, and nothing was added to or removed from
     the text of any record.

