NOTE ON THE DERIVED ANNOTATIONS
  The five feature columns and the 4-class label mapping are the authors' own
  work. Taken alone and without any source text - that is, the contents of
  1_dataset/benchmark/ - they are additionally offered under the Creative Commons
  Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0),
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. This additional offer does not
  extend to 1_dataset/raw/, which contains source text, nor does it remove the
  CC BY-NC 4.0 terms from any file that is distributed together with source
  text.

NOTE ON THE UNDERLYING JUDGMENTS
  The records originate from decisions of the Korean courts. Under Article 7
  of the Korean Copyright Act, judgments and decisions of the courts are not
  subject to copyright protection. The terms above are honoured as the licence
  under which the compiled corpus was made available.
